                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Interview with Suzan Meijer, Head of Objects Conservation at the Rijksmuseum Amsterdam. The topics covered included the interviewee's training to become a Textile Conservator, discussion of conservation projects, approaches and the presence of discoloured textiles in museum collections.This interview contributes to Conservation History in the framework of Oral History."
